    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that, but it doesnt feel that way. it feels like every day i'm just taking more than i give. like, if i weren't here, they could finally breathe. they wouldn't have to worry about me or spend all their energy trying to keep me afloat. it honestly feels like the only way i could actually do something good for them is to stop being a problem.",
